Erdos1131.erdos1131_solution : ∀ (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n),
  ∃ nodes,
    Erdos1131.Admissible nodes ∧
      Erdos1131.energy nodes = Erdos1131.algebraicMinimum n hn ∧
        ∀ (other : Fin n → ℝ), Erdos1131.Admissible other → Erdos1131.algebraicMinimum n hn ≤ Erdos1131.energy other
'Erdos1131.erdos1131_solution' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
